    CHECK --> EMB
    EMB --> SCORE
    SCORE --> TOP50

    TOP50 -- "`**Prioritized Repurposing<br>Candidates**`" --> DASH
    OLLAMA --> DASH
    SAFEGUARDS --> DASH

